{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32910","headline":"紫极宫上元斋次呈诸道流 · 李郢","name":"紫极宫上元斋次呈诸道流","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"碧简朝天章奏频，清宫髣髴降灵真。\n五龙金角向星斗，三洞玉音愁鬼神。\n风拂乱灯山磬□，露沾仙杏石坛春。\n明朝醮罢羽客散，尘土满城空世人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李郢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32910.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32910","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}